        `})]})})},Qu="Oct 8, 2026",Mg=()=>{const{pathname:r}=Yt(),d=r.split("/").pop(),o={privacy:{title:"Privacy Policy",lastUpdated:Qu,sections:[{title:"Who we are",body:`Rawcoderz is a small software company based at ${Se.address}. This policy covers the website rawcoderz.com. If you have a question about it, email ${Se.email}.`},{title:"What we collect",body:"Only what you type into the contact or project form: your name, your email address, your company and your message. We do not run analytics or advertising trackers on this site, and we do not buy or sell personal data."},{title:"Why we collect it",body:"To read your enquiry and reply to it. That is the only reason. We will not add you to a mailing list."},{title:"Who else sees it",body:"The form is delivered through EmailJS to our mailbox. The site is hosted on Vercel, and our host keeps standard server logs, including IP addresses, for security and troubleshooting. Fonts and icons load from Google, and the Tailwind CSS library loads from its public CDN, so those services see your IP address and browser details when your browser requests those files."},{title:"How long we keep it",body:"Enquiry emails stay in our mailbox for as long as we may need them to follow up with you. Ask us and we will delete yours."},{title:"Your choices",body:`Email ${Se.email} to ask what we hold about you, to correct it, or to have it deleted. The site is served over HTTPS.`}]},terms:{title:"Terms & Conditions",lastUpdated:Qu,sections:[{title:"Who we are",body:`rawcoderz.com is run by Rawcoderz, a small software company based at ${Se.address}. You can reach us at ${Se.email}.`},{title:"What this site is",body:"An introduction to us and to the projects we have built. Nothing on it is an offer, a quote or a contract. Where we describe what we could build for an industry, that is a description of possible work, not a promise of a result."},{title:"Paid work",body:"Any work we do for you is covered by a separate written agreement that sets out the scope, the price, the timeline and who owns the result. If that agreement and this page disagree, the agreement applies."},{title:"Using the site",body:"Please do not try to break the site, scrape it in a way that affects other visitors, or use the forms to send spam or anything unlawful."},{title:"Content and ownership",body:"The text, design and code of this site belong to us. Product, company and project names mentioned here belong to their respective owners."},{title:"Links to other sites",body:"We link to live demos of our projects and to third-party platforms. We do not control those sites and are not responsible for their content."},{title:"No warranty",body:"The site is provided as it is. We keep it accurate as best we can, but we cannot promise it is free of errors or always available."},{title:"Governing law",body:`These terms are governed by the laws of India, and any dispute will be subject to the courts of ${Se.city}, ${Se.state}.`}]},cookies:{title:"Cookie Policy",lastUpdated:Qu,sections:[{title:"Cookies we set",body:"None. Rawcoderz does not set any cookies on this site. We use no analytics, no advertising and no tracking pixels, so there is no consent banner to click."},{title:"What the site does load",body:"Fonts and icons from Google, and the Tailwind CSS library from its public CDN. Those services can see your IP address and browser details when your browser requests those files. When you send the contact form, it is delivered through EmailJS."},{title:"Your browser settings",body:"Because we set no cookies, there is nothing here for you to turn off. You can still block third-party requests in your browser: the site will look plainer, but it will work."},{title:"Questions",body:`Email ${Se.email}.`}]}},c=o[d]||o.privacy;return i.jsxs("div",{className:"w-full pt-32 pb-20 px-6 max-w-[1000px] mx-auto min-h-screen",children:[i.jsxs("div",{className:"mb-12 border-b border-white/10 pb-8",children:[i.jsx("div",{className:"inline-flex items